<title>MALAYSIA: Tai Kwong to supply batteries to Proton.</title>
<headline>Tai Kwong to supply batteries to Proton.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian battery maker Tai Kwong Yokohama Bhd said on Thursday it would supply automobile batteries to national car maker Perusahaan Otomobil Nasional Bhd (Proton).</p>
<p>A statement to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said it had entered into an agreement with Proton to act as an original equipment manufacturer.</p>
<p>Tai Kwong officials could not be contacted for comment.</p>
<p>No other details were given.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
